    "达到段落数或字符数上限时会切分批次，跨批次上下文可帮助模型保持人名和语气一致。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When the paragraph or character limit is reached, the batch is split. Context across batches helps the model keep names and tone consistent."
